{"turns":[{"text":"It's always with a purpose.","zh":"那都是有目的的。","start":70.62633333333333,"end":71.878},{"text":"To protect.","zh":"为了保护。","start":72.63066666666667,"end":73.464},{"text":"And make no mistake, there are some people who need killing.","zh":"而且你别搞错了，有些人确实该死。","start":74.72083333333333,"end":77.799},{"text":"Right?","zh":"对吧？","start":79.62,"end":80},{"text":"I'm just really scared.","zh":"我就是真的很害怕。","start":80.8114,"end":81.853},{"text":"I'm so scared.","zh":"我太害怕了。","start":82.95275000000001,"end":83.9},{"text":"Why are you scared?","zh":"你怕什么？","start":84.1134,"end":84.963},{"text":"'Cause he's a bad person.","zh":"因为他是个坏人。","start":85.51849999999999,"end":87.061}],"lessonTurns":[{"text":"It's always with a purpose.","zh":"那都是有目的的。","start":70.62633333333333,"end":71.878},{"text":"To protect.","zh":"为了保护。","start":72.63066666666667,"end":73.464},{"text":"And make no mistake, there are some people who need killing.","zh":"而且你别搞错了，有些人确实该死。","start":74.72083333333333,"end":77.799},{"text":"Right?","zh":"对吧？","start":79.62,"end":80},{"text":"I'm just really scared.","zh":"我就是真的很害怕。","start":80.8114,"end":81.853},{"text":"I'm so scared.","zh":"我太害怕了。","start":82.95275000000001,"end":83.9},{"text":"Why are you scared?","zh":"你怕什么？","start":84.1134,"end":84.963},{"text":"'Cause he's a bad person.","zh":"因为他是个坏人。","start":85.51849999999999,"end":87.061}]}